WEBVTT

00:06:58.439 --> 00:07:00.498
maxa yeelay wax arag ah maba jiro

00:07:00.498 --> 00:07:02.737
waxana kasoo baxay meesha sidii anigoo ku dheelayo

00:07:02.737 --> 00:07:04.521
Heesta ii daaran.

00:07:04.521 --> 00:07:07.049
(Qosol)

00:07:07.049 --> 00:07:09.025
waxa ii xiran koofida dabaasha,

00:07:09.025 --> 00:07:10.117
marka waxba ma maqlo

00:07:10.117 --> 00:07:13.258
waxa ii xeran ookiyaalo misna madaxayga ayaan 50 mar daqiidii geesba gees u wareejiya,

00:07:13.258 --> 00:07:15.300
weli waan heesayaa,

00:07:15.300 --> 00:07:19.241
♪Qiyaas jano la 'aan♪

00:07:19.241 --> 00:07:21.112
♪ doo doo doo doo doo♪

00:07:21.112 --> 00:07:24.084
♪ way fududahay hadaad iskudaydo ♪

00:07:24.084 --> 00:07:25.417
♪doo doo doo doo doo ♪

00:07:25.417 --> 00:07:27.810
kun mar oo iska xigto waan qaadi karaa heestaas.

00:07:27.810 --> 00:07:30.129
(Qosol)